    "_melee": "the punch combo (slot 43: jab, jab, hook) and the jump punch in the air (44): each frame's box is the hit-box editor's Fit to sprite (reach to his fist's furthest pixel, top / bottom his drawing's), so it covers ground badniks under his high fists",
    "_melee_run": "the Grand Upper (slot 45): Y at 4 px a frame or more on the ground; held at 6 px a frame or more the way he faces through the low flaming dash and the rising uppercut, an attack all the way (boxes fitted as the combo's)",
    "_melee_up": "the Dragon Wing (slot 46): up + Y on the ground, costing 10 rings (with fewer, up + Y is the plain punch combo, so the button is never dead and no rings go below 0); the flame wing hits all around him (radial), its reach the flame's furthest pixel sideways",
    "_screw_kick": "the flying jump kick: the jump pressed again in mid-air dives forward-down (5 px along, 4 down a frame) in his flying kick until he lands, an attack, then a small hop (Rouge's Screw Kick on the jump button: kick_jump). Y in mid-air stays the Super transformation when he can, else the jump punch",
    "_physics": "a brawler: 85% acceleration (90% in the air), 95% top speed, Sonic's jump",
    "_no_stomp": "no_stomp (the user, 2026-10-02): his jump is his own jump pose and isn't an attack (a badnik hurts him); rolling and the Spin Dash's release are his slide (\"Rolling\", slot 49: flags roll), which attacks and breaks walls: the Grand Upper's low dash (GRAND1 / GRAND2, its sparks at his feet), a crop of his own sheet; the jump his tucked jump (JUMP_TUCK); the Spin Dash charges crouched"
  },
